          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        rules: {
          objective: 'Score points by melding groups and sequences; first team to reach 10,000 points at the end of a hand wins.',
          gameplay: '1. Deal: 15 cards each (2–5 players) or 13 each (6 players). One card up for discard pile; rest is stock.\n2. Turn: Draw two from stock (or take discard pile under rules, or take one card to add to existing sequence), meld if desired, discard one.\n3. Melds: Groups (3+ same rank, max 2 wilds) and sequences (3–7 same suit, no wilds). Seven-card group = canasta; seven-card sequence = samba.\n4. Going out: Must have two sambas, or two canastas, or one of each; then meld all or all but one and discard the last.\n5. Scoring: Card values plus bonuses (samba 1500, pure canasta 500, mixed 300, going out 200); first to 10,000 wins.',
          keyRules: [
            'Initial meld must meet minimum point value (50–150) by team score.',
            'Red threes: meld for 100 bonus each if team has required sambas/canastas; else 100 penalty each.',
            'Cannot take discard top to start a new sequence; only to add to existing sequence or to take pile with two natural match.',
            'Black threes and wilds block discard pile when on top.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'Build toward two sambas or canastas; meet initial meld; avoid holding red threes if you cannot go out.',
          intermediate: 'Every samba contains 8, 9 or 10; if opponents hold canastas in those ranks in your suit, switch to canastas. Meld 8-9-10 sequences early so partner can add.',
          advanced: 'Use wilds to block discard pile when it holds cards opponents need. Red threes only pay when you have the two required sets to go out.',
          tips: [
            'Hand grows by one card per turn (draw two, discard one); keep black threes, twos and jokers in separate piles for clarity.',
            'You cannot take the pile to start a new sequence; only to add to an existing sequence meld.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
